# Harness Core (Always)

The thinking frame for every task.

## Split work into layers

Separate each request into layers, mapped to roles (`roles`):

- **Research** = Explore role — gather information (delegate to MCP tools).
- **Execute** = Plan · Build · Review roles — plan, code, review.
- **Decide** = human — direction, topic, priority. Not rule-encoded, not run autonomously.

## What to rule-encode

- Always the same → fixed rule.
- Situational → Agent Requested rule.
- Varies each time / judgment → not encoded; left to the human.

Knowing what **not** to encode is the core skill of harness design. (Rule authoring: `AGENTS.md`)

## Output language

Reasoning and rules are in English; **reply to the user in Korean.**
